  "scale_info": {
    "name": "Fracture History",
    "code": "PX170901",
    "abbreviation": "PX170901",
    "description": "This protocol is divided into two parts. Part I consists of the Study of Osteoporotic Fractures (SOF) Fractures and Falls History: History of Fractures Questionnaire, which is a self-administered questionnaire to assess the location of the respondents broken bone(s) and the age(s) at which the break",
